Magi

The Claude Code mod's live clock (claude-mod/hooks/elapsed.tsx) is adapted from
Flightdeck, its units' beating mark (claude-mod/hooks/pulse.tsx) and the bus
under them (claude-mod/hooks/bus.tsx, after Flightdeck's hooks/rail.tsx)
follow Flightdeck's frame-clock pattern, and the deck's layout rules follow it.
https://github.com/scasella/claude-flightdeck

